Code bbport is built on, with its own notices kept in its files:

- shadPS4 (https://github.com/shadps4-emu/shadPS4, GPL-2.0-or-later, Copyright shadPS4 Emulator
  Project): the GPU layer and the shader translator started from its video core and shader
  recompiler and were rewritten part by part (gpu/VENDOR.txt). The online module keeps shadPS4
  v0.20.0's network, NP and shadNet code (gpu/bbnet20/vendor/shadps4, gpu/bbnet20/SHADNET-PORT.md).
- The online module's other parts (gpu/bbnet20: BBSC, The Hunter's Dream pool; GPL-3.0-or-later
  where their files say so) keep their authors' copyright (gpu/bbnet20/SHADNET-PORT.md).
- The DLSS bridge (gpu/dlss_bridge, MIT), adapted from IFreemz's shadPS4-Bloodborne-DLSS-FSR
  (https://github.com/IFreemz/shadPS4-Bloodborne-DLSS-FSR).
- AMD FidelityFX shaders and headers (MIT) in gpu/upscale/shaders/ffx, gpu/third_party and
  tools/fsr4cap/ffx, with AMD's notices.
- The libraries in gpu/third_party (sirit, imgui, half, httplib, fsr-vulkan and others), each under
  its own license in its folder.
- The HDR implementation (gpu/render/hdr_channel.*, gpu/render/bb_tonemap_variants.h,
  gpu/render/shaders/hdr/, gpu/render/shaders/hdr_output.frag) is adapted from
  LanternEngine-NativePlusHDR (https://github.com/LRF17/LanternEngine-NativePlusHDR,
  GPL-2.0-or-later, Copyright 2026 bbport), whose HDR integration itself is not affiliated with
  or endorsed by RenoDX.
- RenoDX (https://github.com/clshortfuse/renodx, MIT, Copyright (C) Carlos Lopez (ShortFuse) and
  contributors): gpu/render/shaders/hdr/renodx.glsl, psychov30.glsl and gamut_bridge.glsl are
  GLSL ports of its shader library (the colorimetry, Neutwo and its inverse, UpgradeToneMap,
  PsychoV-30, the grading, CInfinityRollOff and the gamut and LUT bridges), with its MIT notice
  kept in the files.
- Vanilla+, the default tone mapper of the HDR scene mode (the game's curve up to mid grey,
  continued above it to the display's peak), is souperman9's, from his RenoDX Bloodborne mod.
  The HDR settings menu's layout follows a RenoDX mod's.
